{title: Dil Yeh Beparwah}
{artist: Raj Barman}
{key: C#}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#] Dil bin bole [A#m] jo kuch bole,        [F#] Pehle nahi tha [G#] suna
[C#] Bas muskuraye [A#m] kuch na bataye,        [F#] Jo main puchun [G#] wajah
[C#] Aise kabhi to [A#m] karta nahi tha,        [F#] Jaane isse kya [G#] huwa
[C#] Lagta hai aise [A#m] ishq ne jaise,        [F#] Aakar is hai [G#] chuwa
[C#] Beparwah tumse [A#m] milke huwa hai,        [F#] Dil yeh bepar [G#] wah
[C#] Beparwah mere [A#m] bas main kaha hai,        [F#] Dil yeh bepar [G#] wah
[C#] Hooo [G#] oooo [F#] oooo [G#] Hooo,        [C#] Tujhko jab tak [A#m] main na dekhun
[F#] Dil ko tasalli na [G#] ho,        [C#] Ik pal guzaru [A#m] bin tujhko soche
[F#] Mujhse ye galti na [G#] ho,        [C#] Mujhse bhi jyada [A#m] lagta hai jaise
[F#] Tu mera haqdaar [C#] hai,        [C#] Aankhon ko meri [A#m] chehre se teri
[F#] Shayad huwa pyaar [C#] hai,        [C#] Dil mera hoke [A#m] karne laga hai
[F#] Teri taraf [G#] dariyan,        [C#] Tum ban gaye ho [A#m] pehli tamanna
[F#] Tum akhri ill [G#] taza,        [C#] Beparwah tumse [A#m] milke huwa hai
[F#] Dil yeh bepar [G#] wah,        [C#] Beparwah mere [A#m] bas main kaha hai
[F#] Dil yeh bepar [G#] wah
